#: ../../source/product-overview/ui-ada-changelog.rst:4
msgid ""
"This changelog tracks User Interface (UI) and Accessibility (ADA) changes"
" across Mattermost releases. Administrators can use this page to easily "
"see what changed in the UI from their current version to the one they're "
"upgrading to, and track ADA improvements release to release."
msgstr ""

