msgid "v11.7"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/ui-ada-changelog.rst:16
msgid ""
"(UI) Message attachment footers now support full Markdown rendering, "
"including bold, italic, links, and emoji."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/ui-ada-changelog.rst:18
msgid ""
"(UI) Changed the **Browse Channels** modal and ``~channel`` autocomplete "
"to prioritize channels with a matching display name."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/ui-ada-changelog.rst:20
msgid "(UI) Added an \"Open in new tab\" button to the **Product Switcher** menu."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/ui-ada-changelog.rst:22
msgid ""
"(UI) Substring matching is now allowed when searching channel members in "
"the member sub-panel in a channel."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/ui-ada-changelog.rst:24
msgid "(Accessibility) Improved accessibility of thread list menus."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/ui-ada-changelog.rst:26
msgid "(UI) Improved autocomplete while typing in Korean and using Firefox."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/ui-ada-changelog.rst:28
msgid ""
"(UI) Updated license renewal and expiry notification emails with "
"refreshed branding, copy, and layout."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/ui-ada-changelog.rst:30
msgid ""
"(UI) Added the ability to open channels in a separate popout window, with"
" full channel and right-hand side functionality."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/ui-ada-changelog.rst:32
msgid ""
"(UI) Dropped support for JS features required by browsers over three "
"years old."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/ui-ada-changelog.rst:34
msgid ""
"(UI) Renamed user-visible references from \"Custom Profile Attributes\" "
"to \"User Attributes\" across the admin console, error messages, and "
"server translations."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/ui-ada-changelog.rst:36
msgid ""
"(UI) Added the `ability to handle <https://docs.mattermost.com"
"/administration-guide/onboard/connected-workspaces.html>`__ from which "
"remotes a channel is shared from the channel settings user interface."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/ui-ada-changelog.rst:38
msgid "(UI) Channel banners are now shown in thread views."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/ui-ada-changelog.rst:39
#: ../../source/product-overview/ui-ada-changelog.rst:41
#: ../../source/product-overview/ui-ada-changelog.rst:43
#: ../../source/product-overview/ui-ada-changelog.rst:45
