#: ../../source/product-overview/ui-ada-changelog.rst:59
msgid "v11.6"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/ui-ada-changelog.rst:40
msgid ""
"(UI) Added support for Default Agent in suggestions and integrated Agents"
" into the App Bar."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/ui-ada-changelog.rst:42
msgid ""
"(UI) Improved the reliability of AI recap summarization by using "
"structured JSON output from the LLM."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/ui-ada-changelog.rst:44
msgid ""
"(UI) Added a new feature of creating teams and channels using `anonymous "
"URLs <https://docs.mattermost.com/end-user-guide/collaborate/rename-"
"channels.html>`__ so the channel and team name are not revealed in the "
"URL. Requires Enterprise Advanced license."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/ui-ada-changelog.rst:46
msgid ""
"(UI) Added `popouts <https://docs.mattermost.com/end-user-"
"guide/collaborate/search-for-messages.html#search-for-message>`__ for "
"Recent Mentions, Saved Messages, and Search Results via the right-hand "
"side."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/ui-ada-changelog.rst:48
msgid ""
"(UI) The emoji picker on web and Desktop now inserts unicode emoji "
"characters into the message composer instead of shortcode text."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/ui-ada-changelog.rst:50
msgid ""
"(UI) Renamed Enterprise Advanced feature Content Flagging to Data "
"Spillage."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/ui-ada-changelog.rst:52
msgid ""
"(UI) Added `a contextual note <https://docs.mattermost.com"
"/administration-guide/onboard/sso-google.html#step-3-configure-"
"mattermost-for-google-apps-sso>`__ in Security Settings that explains how"
" Google SSO can synchronize usernames and emails, shown alongside the "
"Sign-in Method details."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/ui-ada-changelog.rst:54
msgid ""
"(UI) Renamed ``SlackAttachment`` and ``SlackAttachmentField`` types to "
"``MessageAttachment`` and ``MessageAttachmentField``. Old names are "
"maintained as deprecated aliases for backward compatibility with plugins."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/ui-ada-changelog.rst:56
msgid ""
"(UI) Posts created by integrations using Slack-compatible attachments "
"(webhooks, bots, plugins) are now fully searchable in Elasticsearch. "
"Previously, only the attachment text field was indexed. Now title, "
"pretext, fallback, and field content are also indexed. A bulk re-index is"
" required after upgrade to apply this to existing posts."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/ui-ada-changelog.rst:58
msgid ""
"(UI) Added timezone support and manual time entry for Interactive Dialog "
"``datetime`` fields."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/ui-ada-changelog.rst:60
msgid ""
"(UI) Added sub-day relative date patterns (H/M/S) for datetime dialog "
"fields, enabling min/max constraints with hour, minute, and second "
"precision."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/ui-ada-changelog.rst:61
#: ../../source/product-overview/ui-ada-changelog.rst:63
#: ../../source/product-overview/ui-ada-changelog.rst:65
