msgid "v11.5"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/ui-ada-changelog.rst:62
msgid ""
"(UI) Added support for `auto-translations <https://docs.mattermost.com"
"/end-user-guide/collaborate/autotranslate-messages.html>`__. Initial Beta"
" release. Requires Enterprise Advanced license."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/ui-ada-changelog.rst:64
msgid ""
"(UI) Added the ability for web app plugin code to be loaded "
"asynchronously."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/ui-ada-changelog.rst:66
msgid ""
"(UI) `AI Rewrites <https://docs.mattermost.com/end-user-guide/collaborate"
"/send-messages.html#rewrite-messages-with-ai>`__ now includes some "
"context from the most recent messages in the thread to help provide "
"better rewrites."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/ui-ada-changelog.rst:68
msgid ""
"(UI) Available AI Agents are now shown in the @-mention autocomplete "
"menu, regardless of channel membership."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/ui-ada-changelog.rst:70
msgid ""
"(UI) Added the ability to access channel settings and rename a channel "
"from the channel info right-hand sidebar."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/ui-ada-changelog.rst:72
msgid ""
"(UI) Added tooltips to action buttons, and action errors are now "
"displayed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/ui-ada-changelog.rst:74
msgid ""
"(UI) Updated the signup flow to replace the newsletter opt-in with a "
"checkbox to agree to the **Acceptable Use Policy** and **Privacy "
"Policy**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/ui-ada-changelog.rst:76
msgid ""
"(UI) Added back `offline Help documentation <https://docs.mattermost.com"
"/end-user-guide/collaborate/send-messages.html>`__ accessible from the "
"message composer."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/ui-ada-changelog.rst:78
msgid ""
"(UI) Added `new icons <https://docs.mattermost.com/end-user-"
"guide/collaborate/channel-types.html#archived-channels>`__ for archived "
"and private channels."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/ui-ada-changelog.rst:80
msgid ""
"(Accessibility) Fixed an issue where the profile status menu disappeared "
"at higher zoom levels or at resized window on mobile view."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/ui-ada-changelog.rst:81
#: ../../source/product-overview/ui-ada-changelog.rst:83
#: ../../source/product-overview/ui-ada-changelog.rst:85
msgid "v11.4"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/ui-ada-changelog.rst:82
msgid ""
"(UI) Updated illustrations and visual design for the initial loading "
"screen, preparing workspace flow, IP filtering empty state, and admin "
"console feature discovery panels."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/ui-ada-changelog.rst:84
msgid ""
"(UI) Added adjustments to thread and right-hand side plugin pop-out "
"titles."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/ui-ada-changelog.rst:86
msgid ""
"(UI) MS Teams and Outlook on mobile no longer display a \"Your browser "
"does not support notifications\" warning banner when running Mattermost "
"embedded in those apps."
msgstr ""

