#: ../../source/product-overview/ui-ada-changelog.rst:88
msgid ""
"(UI) Added Korean language support and upgraded Korean translations from "
"Alpha to Official."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/ui-ada-changelog.rst:90
msgid "(UI) Added pop-outs for right-hand-side (RHS) plugins."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/ui-ada-changelog.rst:92
msgid "(UI) Removed outdated system notices."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/ui-ada-changelog.rst:94
msgid "(UI) Removed the Collapsed Reply Threads tutorial."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/ui-ada-changelog.rst:96
msgid ""
"(UI) Added support for triggering user mentions using the full-width at-"
"sign (＠) in addition to the standard half-width at-sign (@), improving "
"the experience for users of Japanese input methods."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/ui-ada-changelog.rst:98
msgid "(UI) Added the ability to schedule posts in 15-minutes interval."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/ui-ada-changelog.rst:100
msgid "(UI) Updated Giphy SDK from 8.1.0 to 10.1.0."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/ui-ada-changelog.rst:102
msgid ""
"(UI) Custom Profile Attributes now always return a set of `default "
"attributes <https://docs.mattermost.com/administration-guide/manage/admin"
"/user-attributes.html#add-attributes>`__ if they're not set."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/ui-ada-changelog.rst:104
msgid ""
"(UI) Added a new webapp plugin component "
"``registerSidebarBrowseOrAddChannelMenuComponent``, which allows users to"
" add options to the ``BrowseOrCreateChannel`` menu."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/ui-ada-changelog.rst:105
#: ../../source/product-overview/ui-ada-changelog.rst:107
#: ../../source/product-overview/ui-ada-changelog.rst:109
